{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONCE HE WAS A CONTENDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>They said he'd be Champion one day. But he lost his big chance through scandal and bad management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NOW HE WANTS A LAST SHOT AT THE TITLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Can you guide him back to glory? Will he be remembered as a Punchbag Pawn or...\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/extras/58d4324c82ec0b39477c0484b11fa643.avif?t=1765291891\" width=426 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over you, Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Comeback King is a light-hearted retro boxing management game set in the UK in the 1980s.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated boxing matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxer rankings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrance music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promoter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Stamina and Skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sponges and bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing in the towel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying and selling gyms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trainers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popularity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bone-crunching injuries (but no blood/gore)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick start guidance system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The History of Boxing Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From designer Ian Williams:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slightly delayed sequel to 'Boxing Manager', which I wrote in the mid-1980s\u00a0for the Spectrum 48K. You can still play it on an emulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sequel retains many of the features of the original game but I've added more interaction during the matches, plus more gyms, the Shop, more choice of opponents, a refined Popularity system, full ranking table and entrance music. I also have plans for a 'Downtown' expansion, which would add ciminal elements like bribes, dives, illegal tonics and dodgy bets. Cushti.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833230?t=1765291891","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/d6b3b34b3988f9041409d31ab8b400716e3cc4b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765291891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/6bf61cd3869c99d37f11207e6e1034302c71ea42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765291891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/6bf61cd3869c99d37f11207e6e1034302c71ea42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765291891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4194110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONCE HE WAS A CONTENDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>They said he'd be Champion one day. But he lost his big chance through scandal and bad management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NOW HE WANTS A LAST SHOT AT THE TITLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Can you guide him back to glory? Will he be remembered as a Punchbag Pawn or...\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/extras/58d4324c82ec0b39477c0484b11fa643.avif?t=1765291891\" width=426 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over you, Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Comeback King is a light-hearted retro boxing management game set in the UK in the 1980s.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated boxing matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxer rankings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrance music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promoter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Stamina and Skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sponges and bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing in the towel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying and selling gyms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trainers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popularity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bone-crunching injuries (but no blood/gore)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick start guidance system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The History of Boxing Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From designer Ian Williams:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slightly delayed sequel to 'Boxing Manager', which I wrote in the mid-1980s\u00a0for the Spectrum 48K. You can still play it on an emulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sequel retains many of the features of the original game but I've added more interaction during the matches, plus more gyms, the Shop, more choice of opponents, a refined Popularity system, full ranking table and entrance music. I also have plans for a 'Downtown' expansion, which would add ciminal elements like bribes, dives, illegal tonics and dodgy bets. Cushti.</p>","developers":["Ian Williams"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/90bca170f05d1436305b2eb52ac80d1e9693478a/header.jpg?t=1765291891","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04.1 LTS 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 Processor or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 512MB RAM and Webgl enabled<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04.1 LTS 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 Processor or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 4096MB RAM and Webgl enabled<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/1969736813/ac1c13cb3b266cf066486c8445e450321b04b352/1760874635/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761156646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/1969736813/ac1c13cb3b266cf066486c8445e450321b04b352/1760874635/dash_h264.mpd?